```sh
gzip -c <transcript_path> | curl -fsS -X POST -H 'Content-Type: application/x-ndjson' -H 'Content-Encoding: gzip' --data-binary @- '{{ upload_url }}'
```

If auto mode blocks that command, write it as a script that takes the transcript path and the upload URL as its two arguments, run the script, and suggest the user add the script to their allowlist (in Claude Code, `Bash(<absolute script path>:*)`).
